# Stream apply order for this project, most-dependent-first.
#
# Both streams are comment-only. `docs` (explanatory doc comments) applies
# before `book` (Sphinx doc-region markers), so any doc-region markers are
# placed against the documented tree. They touch overlapping files, so the
# order is pinned rather than left to alphabetical chance.
#
# One stream per line; listed streams apply first, in this order. Comments and
# blank lines are ignored.
docs
book
